<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Knight</h1>
<p>In Valhalla the knights are the Dark Knights of Midgaard. Father Nicholas's list of professions calls them Knight; everywhere else they're the Dark Knights. See <a cmd='#'>Help Dark Knight</a> for the profession, and <a cmd='#'>Help Professions</a> for how to change to it.
